<title>UK: INTERVIEW-AEP sees approval of Yorkshire buy.</title>
<headline>INTERVIEW-AEP sees approval of Yorkshire buy.</headline>
<byline>Jeff Daeschner</byline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Electric Power Co Inc and Public Service Co of Colorado said on Monday they expected their planned acquisition of Yorkshire Electricity Group Plc to be cleared by UK regulatory authorities before Britain's next general election.</p>
<p>&quot;If you look at the timelines that have been experienced by other transactions, that would say that there's a high likelihood that it might occur before the election,&quot; AEP chairman Linn Draper said during a telephone conference call with the two companies.</p>
</text>
